<custom_item>
  type                     : AUDIT_POLICY_SUBCATEGORY
  description              : "1.0026 - MSWRK - Ensure 'Audit Other Object Access Events' is set to 'Success and Failure'"
  info                     : "This policy setting allows you to audit events generated by the management of task scheduler jobs or COM+ objects."
