<custom_item>
  type                     : REGISTRY_SETTING
  description              : "1.0229 - MSWRK - Ensure 'Configure multicast DNS (mDNS) protocol' is set to 'Disabled'"
  info                     : "This policy setting determines if the DNS client will perform name resolution over Multicast DNS (mDNS)."
