<custom_item>
  type                     : REGISTRY_SETTING
  description              : "1.0230 - MSWRK - Ensure 'Configure NetBIOS settings' is set to 'Enabled: Disable NetBIOS name resolution on public networks'"
  info                     : "This policy setting specifies if the Domain Name System (DNS) client will perform name resolution over Network Basic Input/Output System (NetBIOS)."
  reference                : "NIST 800-53r5|CM-6 CM-7"
  see_also                 : "See HTH Policies and Standards"
