<custom_item>
  type                     : REGISTRY_SETTING
  description              : "1.0287 - MSWRK - Ensure 'Allow network connectivity during connected-standby (plugged in)' is set to 'Disabled'"
  info                     : "This policy setting allows you to control the network connectivity state in standby on modern standby-capable systems."
  reference                : "NIST 800-53r5|CM-7b."
