<custom_item>
  type                     : REGISTRY_SETTING
  description              : "1.0289 - MSWRK - Ensure 'Allow standby states (S1-S3) when sleeping (plugged in)' is set to 'Disabled'"
  info                     : "This policy setting manages whether or not Windows is allowed to use standby states when putting the computer in a sleep state."
  reference                : "NIST 800-53r5|CM-1 CM-2 CM-6 CM-7 CM-7(1) CM-9 SA-3 SA-8 SA-10"
